<h1 style="line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; text-align: left; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">A Note From the New CRPD Director, Bernita Reese</h1>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Dear Commissioners and Directors,</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">As I begin my time back with Columbus Recreation and Parks Department, I want to share how excited I am to return to Columbus. In the three years I spent at Columbus Recreation and Parks, I came to love this City and its residents, and the department and this team.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">As City leaders, our focus is improving the quality of life for residents. At Columbus Recreation and Parks, we create healthy communities and play a fundamental role in enhancing the physical environments for people of all abilities, ages, socio‐economic backgrounds and ethnicities. Much of this work is accomplished through partnerships with other City departments, and with the support of our Commission. I look forward to working closely with all of you to help lift up the citizens of Columbus.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">I want to thank the Mayor’s office and the Commission for their support and assistance in helping me transition into this position.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">I look forward to writing the next chapter in the City’s and Columbus Recreation and Parks’ legacy together.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Sincerely,</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Bernita</p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2022/01/5364244/bareese-sig1_original.png" style="width: 150px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Bernita A Reese Signature" width="150" height="52"><p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Bernita A. Reese<br>Director, Columbus Recreation and Parks Department</p>
